@SuikerGym.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7000

### Health Check
GET {{SuikerGym.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Contact Health Check
GET {{SuikerGym.Api_HostAddress}}/api/contact/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Programs Health Check
GET {{SuikerGym.Api_HostAddress}}/api/programs/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Get All Programs
GET {{SuikerGym.Api_HostAddress}}/api/programs
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Program by ID - Kort & Krachtig
GET {{SuikerGym.Api_HostAddress}}/api/programs/kort-krachtig
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Program by ID - Core Business
GET {{SuikerGym.Api_HostAddress}}/api/programs/core-business
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Program by ID - Duo Training
GET {{SuikerGym.Api_HostAddress}}/api/programs/duo-training
Accept: application/json

###

### Submit Contact Form - Valid Request
POST {{SuikerGym.Api_HostAddress}}/api/contact
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "goal": "kort&krachtig",
  "firstName": "Jan",
  "lastName": "de Vries",
  "email": "jan.devries@example.com",
  "phone": "+31612345678",
  "message": "Ik wil graag afvallen en fitter worden. Kan ik een gratis proefles krijgen?"
}

###
